{
  "$comment": "generated by stackra gen from stackra.config.ts (pwa.manifest: id, start_url, scope, display, display_override, orientation, categories, shortcuts, screenshots, launch_handler, handle_links, edge_side_panel, related_applications, prefer_related_applications), src/config/pwa.config.ts (manifest.protocolHandlers, manifest.shareTarget, manifest.fileHandlers), src/config/theming.config.ts (theme `acme`: `background` light as theme_color and background_color, dark under user_preferences.color_scheme.dark; logo), src/config/i18n.config.ts (en, ltr, prefix `/`) and assets/lang/en/manifest.json — do not edit. One manifest per locale; that locale's index.html links it. No iarc_rating_id (the console is a business tool, not rated store content) and no note_taking (it takes no notes).",
  "id": "/",
  "name": "Acme Console",
  "short_name": "Console",
  "description": "Orders, catalogue and stock for your store, online or offline.",
  "lang": "en",
  "dir": "ltr",
